Create 3 departments:
HR        VLAN 10
Finance   VLAN 20
IT        VLAN 30


Devices Needed
1 Router (R1)

1 Switch

3 PCs

Addressing Plan
Device	                   IP Address	                  Subnet Mask        	      Gateway
PC1 (HR)	                 192.168.10.10  	            255.255.255.0	            192.168.10.1
PC2 (Finance)	             192.168.20.10	              255.255.255.0	            192.168.20.1
PC3 (IT)	                 192.168.30.10  	            255.255.255.0       	    192.168.30.1


STEP 1 - Connect Devices
Happens in Packet Tracer (Physical Cabling)
Plain Text
PC1 -------- e0/0 SW1
 
PC2 -------- e0/1 SW1
 
PC3 -------- e0/2 SW1
 
SW1 e0/3 --- e0/0 R1



STEP 2 - Create VLANs

✅ Device: SWITCH SW1
enable
configure terminal

vlan 10
name HR

vlan 20
name Finance

vlan 30
name IT

show vlan brief

Expected result 
10 HR
20 Finance
30 IT



STEP 3 - Assign Ports to VLANs
✅ Device: SWITCH SW1
PC1 belongs to VLAN 10

interface fa0/1
switchport mode access
switchport access vlan 10

PC2 belongs to VLAN 20
interface fa0/2
switchport mode access
switchport access vlan 20

PC3 belongs to VLAN 30
interface fa0/3
switchport mode access
switchport access vlan 30

show vlan brief
You should see:
VLAN10  e0/0
VLAN20  e0/1
VLAN30  e0/2


STEP 4 - Configure Trunk Port
✅ Device: SWITCH SW1
The router needs to receive traffic from all VLANs.
Configure the port connected to R1.


interface e0/3
switchport trunk encapsulation dot1q
switchport mode trunk
no shutdown

show interface trunk
Expected
Port      Mode
e0/3      trunk


STEP 5 - Configure Router Interface
✅ Device: ROUTER R1

enable
conf t

interface e0/3
no shutdown


STEP 6 - Create Router Subinterfaces
✅ Device: ROUTER R1
VLAN 10 Gateway

interface e0/0
no shutdown

Vlan 10 Gateway
interface e0/0.10
encapsulation dot1Q 10
ip address 192.168.10.1 255.255.255.0                Default Gateway is 192.168.10.1

Vlan 20 Gateway
interface e0/0.20
encapsulation dot1Q 20
ip address 192.168.20.1 255.255.255.0                 Default Gateway is 192.168.20.1

Vlan 30 Gateway
interface e0/0.30
encapsulation dot1Q 30
ip address 192.168.30.1 255.255.255.0                 Default Gateway is 192.168.30.1

Verify
show ip interface brief


STEP 7 - Configure PCs
✅ Device: PC1
Desktop → IP Configuration
ip 192.168.10.10 255.255.255.0 192.168.10.1

✅ Device: PC2
Desktop → IP Configuration
ip 192.168.20.10 255.255.255.0 192.168.20.1

✅ Device: PC3
Desktop → IP Configuration
ip 192.168.30.10 255.255.255.0 192.168.30.1


STEP 8 - Testing
From PC1
ping PC3
ping 192.168.30.10

From PC2
ping PC3
ping 192.168.30.10



